真实电池放电</title><name>PWR_On_Check</name></caplfunction><caplinline><title>锁存 11 V 输出命令完成时刻</title><code>DischargeStart_s = (int)(timeNowInt64() / 1000000000);</code></caplinline><statecheck><title>确认 11 V 放电输出命令已开启</title><expected><compare><value><dbobject>SysVar_BEGIN_OF_OBJECT|1|Set_OutputSts|N8361|-1|0|END_OF_OBJECT_SysVar|</dbobject></value><eq><const>1</const></eq></compare></expected></statecheck><caplinline><title>最长 2.1 h 等待 LIN 请求，负值及超时均失败并立即收尾</title><code>long result;
long remaining;
remaining = (int)syspar::IBS::SOCWU_ReqWakeTimeout_ms - ((int)(timeNowInt64() / 1000000000) - DischargeStart_s) * 1000;
